    "turn_text": "on ways. Without question, that's a great lesson in life, wherever you are, whatever you are, whoever you're with. You know, you brought up the age thing. I want you to expound just for a half a second here about literally how intelligent the staff people are at that age. They know compared to what I probably knew at that age. Well, I know I didn't know is phenomenal, but I want to reassure people that the staff are incredibly well informed.",
